      "message": "refactor(post): move the folder scan to camcraft-post and pin the Refresh buttons\n\nThe folder scan (scan_folder, FolderScan) works only on a folder and a\nname-to-file table. It moves from crates/app/src/posting_scan.rs to\ncamcraft_post::data_scan, beside data_dir::list_files. app re-exports it.\nThe process cache that binds the scan to the BUILTINS and MACHINES tables\nmoves into posting_files.rs, beside those tables. posting_scan.rs is gone.\n\nThe two Refresh buttons get AccessKit names (\"Refresh machine list\",\n\"Refresh post list\"). The structural twin asserts the role, the enabled\nstate and that a press reads the folders again (posting::scan_reads).\nThe machine page layout test names its Refresh button.\n\nThe scan tests that need no app item move to\ncrates/post/tests/folder_scan.rs. The Gate map of folder_lists.rs cites\n#2380 and uses the camcraft_app:: form.\n\nRefs #2380\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
